# TypeScript ESM

- ESM only. `"type": "module"` in every package.
- Target maintained Node LTS (22 for CI). Do not add Next.js unless a future template selects it.
- `packages/core` must not import `node:net`, `node:http`, `node:fs` write APIs, or any model SDK.
- Public types and schemas belong in `@humanmax/contracts`, not copied into other packages.
- Prefer `node:test` for package tests until a shared runner is introduced on purpose.
